# Trust badges — size-exact PNGs + grey ring

- Use only the owner-supplied web PNGs in `public/badges/`:
  - `10-ev-terepi-tapasztalat-{80,84,104}.png`
  - `orszagos-kiszallas-{80,84,104}.png`
- **Do not re-encode, resize, or regenerate** these files. Copy byte-identical only.
- Hero uses 80 (default) / 84 (`sm+`); footer uses 104 — matching CSS display sizes.
- Országos seals must keep the grey inner ring; `npm run lint:badges` pins SHA-256 and rejects the old ringless plecsni2 hash.
- Never reintroduce `*-v2.png`, `*.source.png`, or unversioned `orszagos-kiszallas.png`.
